  "title": "Café Słonecznik – lunch menu",
  "text": "Café Słonecznik\nLunch menu (12:00–15:00, Monday to Friday)\n\nSoups\nTomato soup – 12 zł\nChicken soup – 14 zł\n\nMain courses\nPierogi with cheese and potatoes – 24 zł\nChicken with rice and salad – 29 zł\nVegetable pasta – 22 zł\n\nDesserts\nApple cake – 12 zł\nIce cream (3 flavours) – 10 zł\n\nDrinks\nCoffee, tea – 8 zł, Orange juice – 9 zł\n\nLunch special: soup + main course + tea = 35 zł\nFree water with every lunch!",
